                        "glosses": [
                            "Characterised or marked by fatigue; tiring."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "425903fa-4ad3-498a-ac33-10756da1365e",
                                "sense_id": "e9dfe726-1b23-3fdc-9f71-0688fdcfddad",
                                "text": "Antiochus was overcome the second time; and after a fatiguesome flight of several days, came at last to his father-in-law Artamenes king of Cappadocia; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "157888f8-b52c-4646-b3c6-816fad2cc6f3",
                                "sense_id": "e9dfe726-1b23-3fdc-9f71-0688fdcfddad",
                                "text": "In Nandy's Chharpoka, for instance, the protagonist felt a fatiguesome burden of the continued drudgery of life."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5e2c268-5c73-4aad-87f2-de52e058ea35",
                                "sense_id": "e9dfe726-1b23-3fdc-9f71-0688fdcfddad",
                                "text": "So deal with ME in others, not that blind shield dodging spreading further blindly irresponsible mechanical trauma of fatiguesome gossip of non-prudence."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
